window.__TFH_I18N_PARTIALS__=window.__TFH_I18N_PARTIALS__||{},window.__TFH_I18N_PARTIALS__.fr=Object.assign(window.__TFH_I18N_PARTIALS__.fr||{},{"home.logo_aria":"Aller au tableau de bord","home.made_with_prefix":"Fait avec","home.made_with_suffix":"par la communaut\xE9","theme.title":"Changer de th\xE8me","theme.aria":"Basculer th\xE8me clair/sombre","auth.login":"Connexion","footer.not_affiliated":"TheFrontHub. Non affili\xE9 \xE0 OpenFront.io.","footer.made_with_pre":"Fait avec","footer.made_with_suf":"par la communaut\xE9","doc.skip_link":"Aller au contenu principal","doc.logo_aria":"Aller au tableau de bord","doc.nav_aria":"Navigation principale","about.topbar_title":"\xC0 propos","about.topbar_subtitle":"TheFrontHub \u2014 le hub communautaire d'OpenFront.io","about.hero_title":"Le hub ultime pour OpenFront.io","about.hero_text":"TheFrontHub centralise tout ce qui compte pour la communaut\xE9 OpenFront : tes speedruns, le class\xE9, les tournois et les stats de chaque joueur \u2014 en un seul endroit, gratuit.","about.cta_discord":"Rejoindre le Discord","about.cta_openfront":"Jouer \xE0 OpenFront.io \u2197","about.mission_title":"Notre mission","about.mission_p1":"OpenFront.io ne fournit aucun site officiel pour suivre ses performances : ni classement de speedruns, ni ladder comp\xE9titif, ni historique de parties. TheFrontHub comble ce vide en collectant automatiquement les donn\xE9es publiques du jeu et en les transformant en classements, graphiques et profils d\xE9taill\xE9s.","about.mission_p2":"Le projet est <b>gratuit, sans compte obligatoire</b> et pens\xE9 d'abord pour les joueurs : comparer tes temps avec tes amis, suivre ta progression en class\xE9, rep\xE9rer les records \xE0 battre et trouver des parties en cours via le lobby.","about.features_title":"Ce que tu trouveras sur TheFrontHub","about.f1_t":"Speedruns","about.f1_d":"Classements par carte et par mode, temps \xE0 battre, records personnels et podiums de la communaut\xE9.","about.f2_t":"Class\xE9 1v1 & 2v2","about.f2_d":"Ladder avec points, rangs, historique de parties et \xE9volution graphique semaine par semaine.","about.f3_t":"Lobby","about.f3_d":"Les parties publiques en direct : rejoins une table lanc\xE9e par la communaut\xE9 en un clic.","about.f4_t":"Atlas","about.f4_d":"Cartes interactives des terrains d'OpenFront : terrains, positions de d\xE9part et particularit\xE9s de chaque map.","about.f5_t":"Tournois & Power Ranking","about.f5_d":"Comp\xE9titions communautaires, inscriptions, calendriers et classement des meilleurs joueurs.","about.f6_t":"Support & communaut\xE9","about.f6_d":"Une \xE9quipe qui r\xE9pond : tickets sur le site, chat en direct et serveur Discord actif.","about.how_title":"Comment \xE7a marche ?","about.how_p1":"Les donn\xE9es du site sont synchronis\xE9es <b>automatiquement et r\xE9guli\xE8rement</b> depuis les informations publiques d'OpenFront.io. En te connectant avec Discord (un clic, sans mot de passe), ton profil OpenFront est li\xE9 \xE0 ton compte TheFrontHub : tes stats, ton historique et tes participations aux tournois te suivent partout.","about.community_title":"Un projet communautaire","about.community_p1":"TheFrontHub est d\xE9velopp\xE9 et maintenu par des fans d'OpenFront.io, sur leur temps libre. Il est financ\xE9 par une publicit\xE9 discr\xE8te qui couvre les co\xFBts d'h\xE9bergement et soutient le d\xE9veloppement du site. Les id\xE9es de la communaut\xE9 fa\xE7onnent les prochaines mises \xE0 jour : propose les tiennes sur le Discord ou via le support.","about.disclaimer":'<b>TheFrontHub est un projet de fans, non affili\xE9 \xE0 OpenFront.io.</b> Tous les noms, marques et contenus li\xE9s au jeu appartiennent \xE0 leurs propri\xE9taires respectifs. Voir nos <a href="legal.html">mentions l\xE9gales</a> et notre <a href="privacy.html">politique de confidentialit\xE9</a>.',"priv.topbar_title":"Politique de confidentialit\xE9","priv.topbar_subtitle":"Cookies, Google Analytics, Google AdSense et tes droits","priv.updated":"Derni\xE8re mise \xE0 jour : 7 septembre 2026","priv.intro":"La protection de ta vie priv\xE9e est importante pour nous. Cette page explique, en toute transparence, quelles donn\xE9es sont collect\xE9es sur TheFrontHub, pourquoi, combien de temps elles sont conserv\xE9es et comment exercer tes droits. En r\xE9sum\xE9 : <b>rien n'est d\xE9pos\xE9 ni lu avant ton choix</b> dans le bandeau cookies, et tu peux changer d'avis \xE0 tout moment.","priv.resp_t":"Responsable du traitement","priv.resp_d":`TheFrontHub \u2014 projet communautaire de fans d'OpenFront.io. Contact du responsable : <a href="mailto:support@thefronthub.com">support@thefronthub.com</a>.`,"priv.data_t":"Donn\xE9es collect\xE9es","priv.data_intro":"Selon ton usage du site, trois cat\xE9gories de donn\xE9es peuvent \xEAtre trait\xE9es :","priv.data_oauth_t":"Donn\xE9es de connexion (OAuth2 Discord et Google)","priv.data_oauth_d":"Lors de l'association de ton profil, nous collectons les informations transmises par Discord ou Google, \xE0 savoir : ton <b>identifiant unique</b>, ton <b>pseudo</b>, ton <b>avatar</b> ainsi que l'<b>adresse e-mail</b> associ\xE9e \xE0 ton compte.","priv.data_oauth_pwd":"<b>Rappel : TheFrontHub ne collecte ni ne stocke aucun mot de passe.</b>","priv.data_game_t":"Statistiques de jeu publiques","priv.data_game_d":"Le site synchronise les <b>donn\xE9es publiques d'OpenFront.io</b> (pseudos, parties, scores, temps, classements) pour construire les leaderboards et profils joueurs. Ces informations sont d\xE9j\xE0 publiques dans le jeu.","priv.data_tech_t":"Donn\xE9es techniques","priv.data_tech_d":"Comme tout site, l'h\xE9bergeur conserve des <b>journaux techniques</b> (adresse IP, navigateur, pages demand\xE9es) \xE0 des fins de s\xE9curit\xE9. Le site utilise aussi le <b>stockage local de ton navigateur</b> (localStorage) pour tes pr\xE9f\xE9rences : th\xE8me, langue et choix cookies.","priv.use_t":"Utilisation de tes donn\xE9es","priv.use_intro":"Les donn\xE9es collect\xE9es servent uniquement aux finalit\xE9s suivantes :","priv.use_1":"<b>Fonctionnement du site :</b> cr\xE9ation et affichage de ton profil, construction des leaderboards et synchronisation de tes statistiques OpenFront.io.","priv.use_2":"<b>Gestion du compte et support :</b> ton adresse e-mail sert uniquement \xE0 l'identification de ton compte et \xE0 te r\xE9pondre en cas de demande de support. Elle n'est jamais transmise \xE0 des tiers, ni vendue, ni utilis\xE9e pour du d\xE9marchage commercial ou des spams.","priv.use_3":"<b>Am\xE9lioration du site :</b> mesure d'audience anonyme via Google Analytics, active uniquement si tu l'acceptes.","priv.use_4":"<b>Financement du site :</b> affichage de publicit\xE9s via Google AdSense, actif uniquement si tu l'acceptes. TheFrontHub d\xE9gage de modestes revenus publicitaires qui couvrent l'h\xE9bergement et soutiennent le d\xE9veloppement du site.","priv.cookies_t":"Cookies et stockage local","priv.cookies_d":"Voici la liste exhaustive des traceurs utilis\xE9s sur TheFrontHub :","priv.th_name":"Nom","priv.th_type":"Cat\xE9gorie","priv.th_purpose":"Finalit\xE9","priv.th_duration":"Dur\xE9e","priv.c1_name":"tfs-consent (localStorage)","priv.c1_type":"Pr\xE9f\xE9rences \u2014 exempt\xE9","priv.c1_purpose":"M\xE9morise ton choix cookies (mesure d'audience / publicit\xE9).","priv.c1_duration":"13 mois max. ou retrait du consentement","priv.c2_name":"tfs-theme, openfront_lang (localStorage)","priv.c2_type":"Pr\xE9f\xE9rences \u2014 exempt\xE9","priv.c2_purpose":"Th\xE8me clair/sombre et langue du site.","priv.c2_duration":"Jusqu'\xE0 effacement de tes donn\xE9es navigateur","priv.c3_name":"Session PHP (cookie)","priv.c3_type":"Strictement n\xE9cessaire","priv.c3_purpose":"Te maintenir connect\xE9 apr\xE8s la connexion Discord.","priv.c3_duration":"Le temps de la session","priv.c4_name":"_ga, _ga_* (Google Analytics)","priv.c4_type":"Mesure d'audience \u2014 sur consentement","priv.c4_purpose":"Statistiques de visite (pages vues, parcours) pour am\xE9liorer le site.","priv.c4_duration":"13 mois maximum","priv.c5_name":"Cookies Google AdSense / DoubleClick","priv.c5_type":"Publicit\xE9 \u2014 sur consentement","priv.c5_purpose":"Affichage et mesure des annonces, personnalisation si accept\xE9e.","priv.c5_duration":"\u2264 13 mois (selon Google)","priv.ga_t":"Google Analytics","priv.ga_d":`Nous utilisons Google Analytics 4 (ID <code>G-GNY8ZYKCZB</code>) pour mesurer l'audience du site de fa\xE7on anonyme. Gr\xE2ce au <b>Consent Mode v2</b>, la mesure est <b>d\xE9sactiv\xE9e par d\xE9faut</b> : aucun cookie analytics n'est d\xE9pos\xE9 et aucun hit n'est envoy\xE9 tant que tu n'as pas accept\xE9 la \xAB mesure d'audience \xBB. Les donn\xE9es sont transmises \xE0 Google, qui peut les traiter hors Union europ\xE9enne (encadrement via les clauses contractuelles types). En savoir plus : <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Confidentialit\xE9 Google</a>.`,"priv.ads_t":"Google AdSense (publicit\xE9)","priv.ads_d":`TheFrontHub est un site gratuit dont le financement repose en partie sur la publicit\xE9 : les annonces Google AdSense (\xE9diteur <code>ca-pub-2991878097014222</code>) g\xE9n\xE8rent de modestes revenus qui couvrent l'h\xE9bergement et soutiennent le d\xE9veloppement du site. <b>Sans ton consentement</b> publicitaire, seules des <b>annonces non personnalis\xE9es</b> peuvent \xEAtre servies, sans profil publicitaire. Si tu acceptes, Google et ses partenaires peuvent d\xE9poser des cookies pour personnaliser les annonces selon tes visites. Tu peux revoir tes pr\xE9f\xE9rences \xE0 tout moment via le bouton \u{1F36A} ou sur <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">adssettings.google.com</a> \u2014 voir aussi <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">publicit\xE9s Google</a>.`,"priv.consent_t":"G\xE9rer ton consentement","priv.consent_d":"Tu as accept\xE9, refus\xE9 ou personnalis\xE9 tes choix ? Tu peux les modifier \xE0 tout moment : le bouton \u{1F36A} en bas \xE0 droite de l'\xE9cran rouvre le panneau de pr\xE9f\xE9rences, et le bouton ci-dessous aussi.","priv.btn_manage":"\u{1F36A} G\xE9rer mes cookies","priv.duration_t":"Dur\xE9e de conservation","priv.duration_d":"<b>Compte (Discord ou Google), y compris l'adresse e-mail :</b> conserv\xE9 tant que ton profil est actif ; supprim\xE9 sur simple demande par email. <b>Statistiques de jeu :</b> conserv\xE9es pour l'historique des classements (dur\xE9e de vie du site). <b>Traceurs :</b> 13 mois maximum (conform\xE9ment aux recommandations de la CNIL). <b>Journaux techniques :</b> dur\xE9e limit\xE9e d\xE9finie par l'h\xE9bergeur (o2switch).","priv.rights_t":"Tes droits (RGPD)","priv.rights_d":'Tu disposes des droits suivants sur tes donn\xE9es personnelles : <b>acc\xE8s</b>, <b>rectification</b>, <b>effacement</b>, <b>limitation</b>, <b>opposition</b> et <b>portabilit\xE9</b>. Pour les exercer, une seule adresse : <a href="mailto:support@thefronthub.com">support@thefronthub.com</a> \u2014 nous r\xE9pondons sous 30 jours. Si tu estimes que tes droits ne sont pas respect\xE9s, tu peux introduire une r\xE9clamation aupr\xE8s de la <a href="https://www.cnil.fr" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">CNIL</a>.',"priv.security_t":"S\xE9curit\xE9","priv.security_d":"Le site est int\xE9gralement servi en <b>HTTPS</b>, h\xE9berg\xE9 en <b>France</b> (o2switch, Toulouse). Les acc\xE8s d'administration sont restreints et authentifi\xE9s. Aucun mot de passe n'est stock\xE9 : l'authentification est d\xE9l\xE9gu\xE9e \xE0 Discord et Google. Les adresses e-mail sont conserv\xE9es de mani\xE8re confidentielle et servent uniquement \xE0 l'identification des comptes et au support.","priv.minors_t":"Mineurs","priv.minors_d":"TheFrontHub s'adresse au grand public. Si tu es mineur, demande l'accord d'un parent avant de cr\xE9er un compte ou d'accepter les cookies publicitaires.","priv.changes_t":"Modifications de cette politique","priv.changes_d":"Cette politique peut \xE9voluer (nouvelles fonctionnalit\xE9s, \xE9volutions l\xE9gales). La date de mise \xE0 jour en haut de page est modifi\xE9e \xE0 chaque changement notable ; les traceurs restent soumis au consentement quel que soit le cas.","priv.questions":'Une question sur cette page ? \xC9cris-nous \xE0 <a href="mailto:support@thefronthub.com">support@thefronthub.com</a> ou ouvre un ticket sur la <a href="support.html">page Support</a>.',"legal.topbar_title":"Mentions l\xE9gales","legal.topbar_subtitle":"\xC9diteur, h\xE9bergement, contact et propri\xE9t\xE9 intellectuelle","legal.updated":"Derni\xE8re mise \xE0 jour : 7 septembre 2026","legal.pub_t":"\xC9diteur du site","legal.pub_d":`<b>TheFrontHub</b> \u2014 projet communautaire \xE9dit\xE9 par des fans d'OpenFront.io, financ\xE9 par une publicit\xE9 discr\xE8te.<br>Directeur de la publication : l'\xE9quipe TheFrontHub.<br>Contact : <a href="mailto:support@thefronthub.com">support@thefronthub.com</a>.`,"legal.host_t":"H\xE9bergement","legal.host_d":'Le site est h\xE9berg\xE9 en France par :<br><b>o2switch SAS</b><br>213-215 rue Jacques-Yves Cousteau, 31200 Toulouse, France<br><a href="https://www.o2switch.fr" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">www.o2switch.fr</a>',"legal.contact_t":"Contact","legal.contact_d":'Une question, un bug, un signalement ? \xC9cris \xE0 <a href="mailto:support@thefronthub.com">support@thefronthub.com</a>, ouvre un ticket sur la <a href="support.html">page Support</a> ou rejoins le <a href="https://discord.gg/AZhmqRvbNh" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Discord TheFrontHub</a>.',"legal.ip_t":"Propri\xE9t\xE9 intellectuelle","legal.ip_d":"La structure, les textes et les d\xE9veloppements du site sont le fruit du travail de la communaut\xE9 TheFrontHub. <b>OpenFront.io</b>, son nom, son contenu et ses \xE9l\xE9ments de jeu appartiennent \xE0 leurs auteurs respectifs : TheFrontHub est un site de fans <b>non affili\xE9</b> au d\xE9veloppeur du jeu. Les donn\xE9es affich\xE9es proviennent des informations publiques d'OpenFront.io. Les polices utilis\xE9es (Inter, Orbitron, JetBrains Mono) sont diffus\xE9es sous licence libre via Google Fonts.","legal.resp_t":"Responsabilit\xE9","legal.resp_d":`Les informations et classements sont fournis "en l'\xE9tat", \xE0 titre indicatif, sans garantie d'exactitude absolue. TheFrontHub ne saurait \xEAtre tenu responsable des interruptions de service, ni du contenu des sites tiers accessibles via des liens externes.`,"legal.data_t":"Donn\xE9es personnelles & cookies","legal.data_d":`Le site utilise des cookies de mesure d'audience (Google Analytics) et de publicit\xE9 (Google AdSense), d\xE9pos\xE9s uniquement apr\xE8s ton consentement. Consulte notre <a href="privacy.html">politique de confidentialit\xE9</a> pour le d\xE9tail, ou g\xE8re tes choix :`,"legal.btn_manage":"\u{1F36A} G\xE9rer mes cookies","legal.law_t":"Droit applicable","legal.law_d":"Le pr\xE9sent site est soumis au droit fran\xE7ais.","legal.credits_t":"Cr\xE9dits","legal.credits_d":"Conception & d\xE9veloppement : la communaut\xE9 TheFrontHub \u2764\uFE0F. Ic\xF4nes : SVG maison (monochromes). Donn\xE9es de jeu : OpenFront.io. H\xE9bergeur : o2switch (France)."}),window.__TFH_I18N_PARTIALS__.en=Object.assign(window.__TFH_I18N_PARTIALS__.en||{},{"home.logo_aria":"Go to the dashboard","home.made_with_prefix":"Made with","home.made_with_suffix":"by the community","theme.title":"Switch theme","theme.aria":"Toggle light/dark theme","auth.login":"Sign in","footer.not_affiliated":"TheFrontHub. Not affiliated with OpenFront.io.","footer.made_with_pre":"Made with","footer.made_with_suf":"by the community","doc.skip_link":"Skip to main content","doc.logo_aria":"Go to the dashboard","doc.nav_aria":"Main navigation","about.topbar_title":"About","about.topbar_subtitle":"TheFrontHub \u2014 the OpenFront.io community hub","about.hero_title":"The ultimate hub for OpenFront.io","about.hero_text":"TheFrontHub brings together everything that matters to the OpenFront community: your speedruns, ranked play, tournaments and every player's stats \u2014 all in one place, for free.","about.cta_discord":"Join the Discord","about.cta_openfront":"Play OpenFront.io \u2197","about.mission_title":"Our mission","about.mission_p1":"OpenFront.io offers no official site to track your performance: no speedrun leaderboards, no competitive ladder, no match history. TheFrontHub fills that gap by automatically collecting the game's public data and turning it into rankings, charts and detailed player profiles.","about.mission_p2":"The project is <b>free, with no mandatory account</b> and built for players first: compare your times with friends, follow your ranked progress, spot the records to beat and find live games through the lobby.","about.features_title":"What you'll find on TheFrontHub","about.f1_t":"Speedruns","about.f1_d":"Leaderboards per map and mode, times to beat, personal records and community podiums.","about.f2_t":"Ranked 1v1 & 2v2","about.f2_d":"Ladder with points, ranks, match history and week-by-week progress charts.","about.f3_t":"Lobby","about.f3_d":"Live public games: join a table started by the community in one click.","about.f4_t":"Atlas","about.f4_d":"Interactive maps of OpenFront terrains: terrain types, spawn positions and quirks of every map.","about.f5_t":"Tournaments & Power Ranking","about.f5_d":"Community competitions, sign-ups, schedules and rankings of the best players.","about.f6_t":"Support & community","about.f6_d":"A team that answers: tickets on the site, live chat and an active Discord server.","about.how_title":"How does it work?","about.how_p1":"Site data is synced <b>automatically and regularly</b> from OpenFront.io's public information. Signing in with Discord (one click, no password) links your OpenFront profile to your TheFrontHub account: your stats, history and tournament entries follow you everywhere.","about.community_title":"A community project","about.community_p1":"TheFrontHub is developed and maintained by OpenFront.io fans in their spare time. It is funded by discreet advertising that covers hosting costs and supports the site's development. Community ideas shape upcoming updates: share yours on Discord or through support.","about.disclaimer":'<b>TheFrontHub is a fan project, not affiliated with OpenFront.io.</b> All game-related names, brands and content belong to their respective owners. See our <a href="legal.html">legal notice</a> and <a href="privacy.html">privacy policy</a>.',"priv.topbar_title":"Privacy Policy","priv.topbar_subtitle":"Cookies, Google Analytics, Google AdSense and your rights","priv.updated":"Last updated: September 7, 2026","priv.intro":"Your privacy matters to us. This page transparently explains what data TheFrontHub collects, why, how long it is kept and how to exercise your rights. In short: <b>nothing is stored or read before your choice</b> in the cookie banner, and you can change your mind at any time.","priv.resp_t":"Data controller","priv.resp_d":'TheFrontHub \u2014 a community project by OpenFront.io fans. Controller contact: <a href="mailto:support@thefronthub.com">support@thefronthub.com</a>.',"priv.data_t":"Data we collect","priv.data_intro":"Depending on how you use the site, three categories of data may be processed:","priv.data_oauth_t":"Sign-in data (Discord & Google OAuth2)","priv.data_oauth_d":"When you link your profile, we collect the information transmitted by Discord or Google, namely: your <b>unique ID</b>, your <b>username</b>, your <b>avatar</b> and the <b>email address</b> associated with your account.","priv.data_oauth_pwd":"<b>Note: TheFrontHub never collects or stores any password.</b>","priv.data_game_t":"Public game statistics","priv.data_game_d":"The site syncs <b>public OpenFront.io data</b> (usernames, matches, scores, times, rankings) to build leaderboards and player profiles. This information is already public in the game.","priv.data_tech_t":"Technical data","priv.data_tech_d":"Like any website, the host keeps <b>technical logs</b> (IP address, browser, requested pages) for security purposes. The site also uses your <b>browser's local storage</b> (localStorage) for your preferences: theme, language and cookie choices.","priv.use_t":"Use of your data","priv.use_intro":"The data collected is used for the following purposes only:","priv.use_1":"<b>Site operation:</b> creating and displaying your profile, building leaderboards and syncing your OpenFront.io statistics.","priv.use_2":"<b>Account management and support:</b> your email address is only used to identify your account and to reply to support requests. It is never shared with third parties, sold, or used for commercial prospecting or spam.","priv.use_3":"<b>Site improvement:</b> anonymous audience measurement via Google Analytics, active only if you consent.","priv.use_4":"<b>Site funding:</b> ad display via Google AdSense, active only if you consent. TheFrontHub earns modest ad revenue that covers hosting and supports the site's development.","priv.cookies_t":"Cookies and local storage","priv.cookies_d":"Here is the exhaustive list of trackers used on TheFrontHub:","priv.th_name":"Name","priv.th_type":"Category","priv.th_purpose":"Purpose","priv.th_duration":"Duration","priv.c1_name":"tfs-consent (localStorage)","priv.c1_type":"Preferences \u2014 exempt","priv.c1_purpose":"Remembers your cookie choice (analytics / ads).","priv.c1_duration":"13 months max. or consent withdrawal","priv.c2_name":"tfs-theme, openfront_lang (localStorage)","priv.c2_type":"Preferences \u2014 exempt","priv.c2_purpose":"Light/dark theme and site language.","priv.c2_duration":"Until you clear your browser data","priv.c3_name":"PHP session (cookie)","priv.c3_type":"Strictly necessary","priv.c3_purpose":"Keeps you signed in after Discord authentication.","priv.c3_duration":"Session only","priv.c4_name":"_ga, _ga_* (Google Analytics)","priv.c4_type":"Analytics \u2014 consent-based","priv.c4_purpose":"Visit statistics (page views, journeys) to improve the site.","priv.c4_duration":"13 months maximum","priv.c5_name":"Google AdSense / DoubleClick cookies","priv.c5_type":"Advertising \u2014 consent-based","priv.c5_purpose":"Ad serving and measurement, personalization if accepted.","priv.c5_duration":"\u2264 13 months (per Google)","priv.ga_t":"Google Analytics","priv.ga_d":'We use Google Analytics 4 (ID <code>G-GNY8ZYKCZB</code>) to anonymously measure site traffic. Thanks to <b>Consent Mode v2</b>, measurement is <b>off by default</b>: no analytics cookie is set and no hit is sent until you accept "audience measurement". Data is passed to Google, which may process it outside the European Union (under standard contractual clauses). Learn more: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google Privacy</a>.',"priv.ads_t":"Google AdSense (advertising)","priv.ads_d":`TheFrontHub is a free site whose funding relies partly on advertising: Google AdSense ads (publisher <code>ca-pub-2991878097014222</code>) generate modest revenue that covers hosting and supports the site's development. <b>Without your ad consent</b>, only <b>non-personalized ads</b> may be served, with no advertising profile. If you accept, Google and its partners may set cookies to personalize ads based on your visits. You can review your preferences anytime via the \u{1F36A} button or at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">adssettings.google.com</a> \u2014 see also <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google advertising</a>.`,"priv.consent_t":"Manage your consent","priv.consent_d":"Accepted, denied or customized your choices? You can change them at any time: the \u{1F36A} button at the bottom right of the screen reopens the preferences panel \u2014 and so does the button below.","priv.btn_manage":"\u{1F36A} Manage my cookies","priv.duration_t":"Data retention","priv.duration_d":"<b>Account (Discord or Google), including the email address:</b> kept while your profile is active; deleted on simple email request. <b>Game statistics:</b> kept for leaderboard history (site lifetime). <b>Trackers:</b> 13 months maximum (per CNIL recommendations). <b>Technical logs:</b> limited duration defined by the host (o2switch).","priv.rights_t":"Your rights (GDPR)","priv.rights_d":'You have the following rights over your personal data: <b>access</b>, <b>rectification</b>, <b>erasure</b>, <b>restriction</b>, <b>objection</b> and <b>portability</b>. To exercise them, one address: <a href="mailto:support@thefronthub.com">support@thefronthub.com</a> \u2014 we reply within 30 days. If you believe your rights are not respected, you can file a complaint with the <a href="https://www.cnil.fr" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">CNIL</a> (French DPA).',"priv.security_t":"Security","priv.security_d":"The site is served entirely over <b>HTTPS</b>, hosted in <b>France</b> (o2switch, Toulouse). Administrative access is restricted and authenticated. No passwords are stored: authentication is delegated to Discord and Google. Email addresses are kept confidential and used only for account identification and support.","priv.minors_t":"Minors","priv.minors_d":"TheFrontHub is intended for the general public. If you are a minor, ask a parent's permission before creating an account or accepting advertising cookies.","priv.changes_t":"Changes to this policy","priv.changes_d":"This policy may evolve (new features, legal changes). The update date at the top of the page changes with every notable amendment; trackers remain subject to consent in all cases.","priv.questions":'A question about this page? Write to us at <a href="mailto:support@thefronthub.com">support@thefronthub.com</a> or open a ticket on the <a href="support.html">Support page</a>.',"legal.topbar_title":"Legal notice","legal.topbar_subtitle":"Publisher, hosting, contact and intellectual property","legal.updated":"Last updated: September 7, 2026","legal.pub_t":"Site publisher","legal.pub_d":'<b>TheFrontHub</b> \u2014 a community project run by OpenFront.io fans, funded by discreet advertising.<br>Publication director: TheFrontHub team.<br>Contact: <a href="mailto:support@thefronthub.com">support@thefronthub.com</a>.',"legal.host_t":"Hosting","legal.host_d":'The site is hosted in France by:<br><b>o2switch SAS</b><br>213-215 rue Jacques-Yves Cousteau, 31200 Toulouse, France<br><a href="https://www.o2switch.fr" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">www.o2switch.fr</a>',"legal.contact_t":"Contact","legal.contact_d":'A question, a bug, a report? Write to <a href="mailto:support@thefronthub.com">support@thefronthub.com</a>, open a ticket on the <a href="support.html">Support page</a> or join the <a href="https://discord.gg/AZhmqRvbNh" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">TheFrontHub Discord</a>.',"legal.ip_t":"Intellectual property","legal.ip_d":"The site's structure, texts and code are the work of TheFrontHub community. <b>OpenFront.io</b>, its name, content and game assets belong to their respective authors: TheFrontHub is a fan site <b>not affiliated</b> with the game's developer. Displayed data comes from OpenFront.io's public information. Fonts used (Inter, Orbitron, JetBrains Mono) are open-licensed via Google Fonts.","legal.resp_t":"Liability","legal.resp_d":'Information and rankings are provided "as is", for information purposes, with no guarantee of absolute accuracy. TheFrontHub cannot be held liable for service interruptions or for the content of third-party sites reached through external links.',"legal.data_t":"Personal data & cookies","legal.data_d":'The site uses analytics cookies (Google Analytics) and advertising cookies (Google AdSense), set only after your consent. See our <a href="privacy.html">privacy policy</a> for details, or manage your choices:',"legal.btn_manage":"\u{1F36A} Manage my cookies","legal.law_t":"Governing law","legal.law_d":"This website is governed by French law.","legal.credits_t":"Credits","legal.credits_d":"Design & development: the TheFrontHub community \u2764\uFE0F. Icons: in-house monochrome SVGs. Game data: OpenFront.io. Host: o2switch (France)."});
